		"Electricity Pylon are a handy electric carrying machine that can carry electricity over long distances.",
		"",
		"To construct these type of electric pylon you need three components, the pylon, the \"mini\" capacitor, and a Capacitor Bus.",
		"",
		"You place these Pylon, Capacitor, and Capacitor Bus all on top of each other in that order. ",
		"You only need one of theses transformer pylons, to start carrying the electricity place pylons (without capacitor or capacitor bus needed) and connect them with Cable Drum.",
		"",
		"You may change the color of the cable connecting the pylons with dye."
